## Authentication

Uses `Coder-Session-Token` header for all API calls (both self-hosted and Hub flows):

```typescript
private async apiRequest<T>(method: string, path: string, body?: unknown): Promise<T> {
  const response = await fetch(`${this.url}${path}`, {
    method,
    headers: {
      'Coder-Session-Token': this.authToken,
      'Content-Type': 'application/json',
    },
    body: body ? JSON.stringify(body) : undefined,
  });

  if (!response.ok) {
    throw new CoderApiError(response.status, await response.text());
  }

  return response.json();
}
```

